Bitwise operations are not just theory.

They are heavily used in: ✅ Cryptography
✅ Compression algorithms
✅ Competitive programming
✅ System design
✅ Performance optimization
✅ Flags and masking operations

When you understand bit shifting, you stop thinking in numbers —
You start thinking in bits.

